because my identity

01:03:20.570 --> 01:03:22.070
is that I belong to God.

01:03:24.890 --> 01:03:26.350
And so God, if there are difficulties,

01:03:26.350 --> 01:03:28.010
if there are obstacles, I pray that you

01:03:28.010 --> 01:03:30.010
use this time to bring them

01:03:30.010 --> 01:03:32.030
to the surface, not just so that we can

01:03:32.030 --> 01:03:34.030
be aware of them, but as we pray

01:03:34.030 --> 01:03:35.870
through them and as we bring them to you, you could break

01:03:35.870 --> 01:03:36.490
some of those.

01:03:37.970 --> 01:03:38.670
Break through

01:03:38.670 --> 01:03:41.690
so that our identity, our core identity,

01:03:41.850 --> 01:03:43.910
our main identity, is I am

01:03:43.910 --> 01:03:48.020
loved by God. Help us

01:03:48.020 --> 01:03:49.800
tonight. In Jesus' name.

01:03:50.240 --> 01:03:50.460
Amen.
